### 基础分页查询
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?pageNumber=0&pageSize=5
Content-Type: application/json

### 查询用户名包含 "user" 的用户
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?username=u
Content-Type: application/json

### 查询订单金额大于 110 的用户
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?minAmount=110
Content-Type: application/json

### 查询下单时间在某个范围内的用户（需要 URL 编码）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?orderStartTime=2025-01-01T00:00:00&orderEndTime=2025-12-31T23:59:59
Content-Type: application/json

### 组合所有条件
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?username=user&minAge=25&maxAge=35&minAmount=120&sort=age,asc&page=0&size=3
Content-Type: application/json




